`comment("Benign: lookup has owner, expiry, and freshness evidence before suppressing scanner activity")`
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4624
| lookup approved_scanner_sources ip as IpAddress OUTPUT owner ticket expires_at last_updated
| eval expires_epoch=strptime(expires_at, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ")
| eval updated_epoch=strptime(last_updated, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ")
| where isnull(ticket) OR now() > expires_epoch OR now() - updated_epoch > 86400
| stats count by TargetUserName, IpAddress, owner, ticket, expires_at, last_updated
